// OmniFlow 265 - website analytics on Neon through the Control Plane (owner decision: no Supabase).
// Website: the analytics server module now sends events to the Control Plane and reads the admin
// numbers back from it; the track route, the cron route and the admin page are untouched.
// Control Plane: new portal_site_analytics.py (service-key guarded) + the app.py wiring.
// NO SQL anywhere - the Control Plane creates site_settings / site_events / site_maintenance_log
// on the tenant database the first time a route is called. db/site_analytics.sql and
// db/site_analytics_fix.sql are legacy Supabase-era files: do not run them.
// Run from the website root (the folder that has package.json): node site_analytics_265.mjs
// Safe to run again: a file that already has the 265 marker is reported as already.
